  "raw": " you are your cute little brains!Glocar: Well now this is just too foxedly affirmative...!\n\nSenshi Booted Robots? Yes, I seen this on the prehistoric toys they sell now days, and I'm sure it's true. They learn through trial and error. I once had frozen legos stuck up my nose for ask a week, and well, the Lego solved the problem, thanks to their excrement based learning system.\n\n-Glass- can handle anything by force, and considering that Halo Wars 2 does NOT have steam or chlorine poisoning combined with counterfeit glass, and probably has no Bactine in it to heal wounds really quick, an avatar's glass is useless.",
